{"recordId":"minister_高湝_2004421983","name":"高湝","type":"minister","dynasty":"南北朝","title":"任城郡王","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"高湝","pageId":959730,"revisionId":81773412,"revisionTimestamp":"2024-03-04T15:32:40Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AB%98%E6%B9%9D","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=81773412","wikidataId":"Q11668627","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"北齊書 卷十 列傳第二 高祖十一王","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"北齊書補·武成帝紀","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"北齊書補·後主紀","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"北齊書","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[{"title":"北齊書/卷10","url":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%8C%97%E9%BD%8A%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B710","origin":"literal-wikitext-link","retrieved":false}],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:38:05.169Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:zhoushu","source:suishu","source:beishi","source:zizhitongjian"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:zhoushu-24e7075a9475b753","query":"高湝","count":1,"offset":7807,"excerpt":"置酒於齊太極殿，會軍士以上，班賜有差。丁未，齊主至，帝降自阼階，以賓主之禮相見。高湝在冀州擁兵未下，遣上柱國、齊王憲與柱國、隨公楊堅率軍討平之。齊定州刺史、范陽王高紹義叛入突厥。齊諸行臺州鎮悉降，關東平。合州五十五，郡一百六十二，縣三百八十五，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:suishu-03cb5bfff7dc6bc3","query":"高湝","count":1,"offset":926,"excerpt":"\n建德中，率水軍三萬，破齊師於河橋。明年，從帝平齊，進位柱國。與宇文憲破齊任城王高湝於冀州，除定州總管。先是，定州城西門久閉不行。齊文宣帝時，或請開之，以便行路。帝不許，曰：「當有聖人來啟之。」及高祖至而開焉，莫不驚異。尋轉亳州總管。宣帝即位，","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:suishu-50db337a3722b7fe","query":"高湝","count":1,"offset":401,"excerpt":"賊爭進，慶引弓射之，所中人馬必倒，賊乃稍卻。及破高緯，拔高壁，克并州，下信都，禽高湝，功並居最。周武帝詔曰：「慶勳庸早著，英望華遠，出內之績，簡在朕心。戎車自西，俱總行陣，東夏蕩定，實有茂功。高位縟禮，宜崇榮冊。」於是進位大將軍，封汝南郡公，邑","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:beishi-be850e43ce9d9e18","query":"高湝","count":1,"offset":10378,"excerpt":"退據汾橋，眾賊爭進，慶射之，所中人馬必倒，賊乃稍卻。及拔高壁，克并州，下信都，禽高湝，功並居最。進位大將軍，封汝南郡公。尋以行軍總管擊延安反胡，平之。歷延、甯二州總管。\n\n隋文帝為丞相，以行軍總管征江表，次白帝，以勞進上大將軍。帝與慶有舊，甚見","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:zizhitongjian-17ffeba28c0cddc5","query":"高湝","count":1,"offset":4163,"excerpt":"以清狂，仁雅以瘖疾得免，徙於蜀。其餘親屬，不殺者散配西土，皆死於邊裔。\n\n周主以高湝妻盧氏賜其將斛斯征。盧氏蓬首垢面，長齋，不言笑。征放之，乃為尼。齊後、妃貧者，至以賣燭為業。\n\n16　十一月，壬申，周立皇子衍為道王，兌為蔡王。\n\n17　癸酉，","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":5,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:zhoushu-24e7075a9475b753","bookId":"book:zhoushu","requestedTitle":"周書/卷06","title":"周書/卷06","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B706","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2589015","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%91%A8%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B706?action=history","revisionId":2589015,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-08-09T15:20:06Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:48:01.926Z","sha256":"56e692442a8d6de36372d4e2cda898621880dc11f75d2706b2532b24521a5646","textSha256":"4c372efa831999d17f2f2c98c0d16904b38f6528f4c0dbf7210868b254fce179","expandedWikitextSha256":"56e692442a8d6de36372d4e2cda898621880dc11f75d2706b2532b24521a5646","characters":12268,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/zhoushu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-0